- this directory contains the skeleton for part 2
  of the simple regex FSM matcher final test

- specifically, this is an incomplete version of a Finite State
  Machine framework module that can be used for many purposes,
  but here we'll use it to implement regex pattern matching
  efficiently.

- Files include:

fsm.[ch]:	Finite State Machine module - fsm.c is a skeleton.
testfsm.c:	Unit test program for fsm module.
token.[ch]:	Tokens and token acceptor function.
.cbuild:	Custom CB config file to compile the test program(s)
		and link them with the support library.

- we also depend on ../lib/*, look in there for (eg) regex.h
